<title>USA: Celestial Seasonings Inc Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Celestial Seasonings Inc Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BOULDER, Colo. 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>PRO FORMA CONSOLIDATED INCOME STATEMENTS</p>
<p>		     (in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>			     Three Months Ended  Twelve Months Ended</p>
<p>					   September 30,  September 30,</p>
<p>					1996    1995(1)  1996    1995(1)</p>
<p> Case volume			   832	831   4,338   4,274</p>
<p> Net sales			 $14,587  $13,482 $72,998  70,104</p>
