<p>					 4,118    4,093   4,115   4,086</p>
<p>NOTE: (1) 1995 income tax expense is provided at 39 percent for fiscal year l995 and assumes no net operating loss carryforwards.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
